{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot;It's tough being the servant of an Evil God&quot;</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>After the sun sets and the clock strikes midnight, your task begins:</strong> you must feed your master before the first light of dawn. How hard can it possibly be to survive the night?... <br><strong>KAISA: Resurrection</strong> is a brutal, strategic roguelite with a dark, culty vibe and a sound-based threat system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025870/extras/ec70460d6fb257fca1a1187f247a702d.poster.avif?t=1770969804\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025870/extras/ec70460d6fb257fca1a1187f247a702d.webm?t=1770969804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025870/extras/ec70460d6fb257fca1a1187f247a702d.mp4?t=1770969804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beware of the Shopkeeper.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all entities in the world care for your mission or existence...<br>Make too much noise at night and find out more about the crushing fist of the Shopkeeper. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025870/extras/80582911c22c7d0419db8f2a64a66c6c.poster.avif?t=1770969804\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025870/extras/80582911c22c7d0419db8f2a64a66c6c.webm?t=1770969804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025870/extras/80582911c22c7d0419db8f2a64a66c6c.mp4?t=1770969804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Death &amp; Creation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is death really? When you are in the service of an evil God, it's not without its perks! When you die horribly it's more of an opportunity to be reassembled with new exciting body parts you found on your previous attempt.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025870/extras/1039cf549b0217ff665d713cec38383b.poster.avif?t=1770969804\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025870/extras/1039cf549b0217ff665d713cec38383b.webm?t=1770969804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025870/extras/1039cf549b0217ff665d713cec38383b.mp4?t=1770969804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Death is not the end, just an opportunity for self-improvement! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Daytime</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the daylight hours when you master sleeps, what you do is up to you.\u00a0<strong>This is a race against the clock.</strong> Scavenge the house, acquire upgrades, and <strong>perhaps find a way to stretch your freedom</strong> from your demanding God.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025870/extras/c4ebbec1dd3f50d033aef6fbd1a63a61.poster.avif?t=1770969804\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025870/extras/c4ebbec1dd3f50d033aef6fbd1a63a61.webm?t=1770969804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025870/extras/c4ebbec1dd3f50d033aef6fbd1a63a61.mp4?t=1770969804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Just make sure to be back before midnight. <br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KAISA: Resurrection - Roadmap</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025870/extras/5d132818484315f0f5c572adf21a16fc.avif?t=1770969804\" width=1170 height=1073 /></span>\u00a0   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Night-Time</strong>, Feed your master in a difficult small arena battler setting.\u00a0 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daytime</strong>, Scavenge, Prepare and explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock</strong> new weapons, body parts and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a world heavily inspired by <strong>90s campy horror</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beware of the noise</strong>\u00a0you make.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything is as it seems.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About us:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re a small, passionate two-man team that has been working hard for over 3 years to bring this game to life.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magnus the artist:</strong>\u00a0Leading the project, does the visuals, sound fx and gameplay side of things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bj\u00f6rn the programmer:</strong> Makes it all run with\u2026 dark magic?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Our Vision</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Kaisa: Resurrection</i> is meant to be a <strong>hard,</strong>\u00a0this is not a straight hack and slash, it's more of a delicate stab in the dark. It\u2019s <strong>challenging, bloody, and unforgiving</strong>, but every victory is earned.<br> <br> <br>  <br>Your task has already begun.\u00a0<strong>KAISA commands you. </strong>Wishlist now, or join our Early Access!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Butcher Knife","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2025870/fa98ea5bf5033c58d32f83bf776f4fd137be7113.jpg"},{"name":"Chopsticks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2025870/0e1e8fa7efb3bc0e6902fca51076b517c7d6a007.jpg"},{"name":"Rat Killer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2025870/e605342925a6b21fec86936008a21673a8c03a6e.jpg"},{"name":"Terrible Minion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2025870/568dcf51d15b30ff3bb2767261381c6e875a979a.jpg"},{"name":"Shame On You","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2025870/5ba46c8f331a346c2d813e9f544b0bf852411801.jpg"},{"name":"What One Does For Money!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2025870/5c0be1d2c4d22d5e0c8c540665cdceadb8545264.jpg"},{"name":"Silence Of The Chainsaw","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2025870/859f78dcb290153e3d3456ce1e5ec4b0d158c4e9.jpg"},{"name":"Handyman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2025870/fdab92de99317777f37e376d0e261c0149cbb651.jpg"},{"name":"Unstoppable","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2025870/430270880ddcbdfa06b071ec026ee7116c7ad7e5.jpg"},{"name":"Trash Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2025870/4df056264d8ef38059cad21478c0d4ca1c997510.jpg"}],"total":31},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2025870?t=1770969804","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025870/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770969804","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025870/77c500c7ba272d2b93461175ef652f5bfb498545/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770969804","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025870/77c500c7ba272d2b93461175ef652f5bfb498545/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770969804","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3528540,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot;It's tough being the servant of an Evil God&quot;</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>After the sun sets and the clock strikes midnight, your task begins:</strong> you must feed your master before the first light of dawn. How hard can it possibly be to survive the night?... <br><strong>KAISA: Resurrection</strong> is a brutal, strategic roguelite with a dark, culty vibe and a sound-based threat system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025870/extras/ec70460d6fb257fca1a1187f247a702d.poster.avif?t=1770969804\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025870/extras/ec70460d6fb257fca1a1187f247a702d.webm?t=1770969804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025870/extras/ec70460d6fb257fca1a1187f247a702d.mp4?t=1770969804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beware of the Shopkeeper.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all entities in the world care for your mission or existence...<br>Make too much noise at night and find out more about the crushing fist of the Shopkeeper. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025870/extras/80582911c22c7d0419db8f2a64a66c6c.poster.avif?t=1770969804\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025870/extras/80582911c22c7d0419db8f2a64a66c6c.webm?t=1770969804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025870/extras/80582911c22c7d0419db8f2a64a66c6c.mp4?t=1770969804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Death &amp; Creation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is death really? When you are in the service of an evil God, it's not without its perks! When you die horribly it's more of an opportunity to be reassembled with new exciting body parts you found on your previous attempt.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025870/extras/1039cf549b0217ff665d713cec38383b.poster.avif?t=1770969804\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025870/extras/1039cf549b0217ff665d713cec38383b.webm?t=1770969804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025870/extras/1039cf549b0217ff665d713cec38383b.mp4?t=1770969804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Death is not the end, just an opportunity for self-improvement! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Daytime</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the daylight hours when you master sleeps, what you do is up to you.\u00a0<strong>This is a race against the clock.</strong> Scavenge the house, acquire upgrades, and <strong>perhaps find a way to stretch your freedom</strong> from your demanding God.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025870/extras/c4ebbec1dd3f50d033aef6fbd1a63a61.poster.avif?t=1770969804\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025870/extras/c4ebbec1dd3f50d033aef6fbd1a63a61.webm?t=1770969804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025870/extras/c4ebbec1dd3f50d033aef6fbd1a63a61.mp4?t=1770969804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Just make sure to be back before midnight. <br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KAISA: Resurrection - Roadmap</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025870/extras/5d132818484315f0f5c572adf21a16fc.avif?t=1770969804\" width=1170 height=1073 /></span>\u00a0   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Night-Time</strong>, Feed your master in a difficult small arena battler setting.\u00a0 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daytime</strong>, Scavenge, Prepare and explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock</strong> new weapons, body parts and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a world heavily inspired by <strong>90s campy horror</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beware of the noise</strong>\u00a0you make.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything is as it seems.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About us:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re a small, passionate two-man team that has been working hard for over 3 years to bring this game to life.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magnus the artist:</strong>\u00a0Leading the project, does the visuals, sound fx and gameplay side of things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bj\u00f6rn the programmer:</strong> Makes it all run with\u2026 dark magic?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Our Vision</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Kaisa: Resurrection</i> is meant to be a <strong>hard,</strong>\u00a0this is not a straight hack and slash, it's more of a delicate stab in the dark. It\u2019s <strong>challenging, bloody, and unforgiving</strong>, but every victory is earned.<br> <br> <br>  <br>Your task has already begun.\u00a0<strong>KAISA commands you. </strong>Wishlist now, or join our Early Access!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Hatokuma Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025870/header.jpg?t=1770969804","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"min